## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design and integrate real-time, cross-platform native modules while handling performance constraints, privacy considerations, and device-specific optimizations for camera-derived data streams.

## Key Concepts

- Cross-platform native modules (TurboModule/JSI)
- Real-time data pipelines and backpressure handling
- Memory and battery optimization for per-frame processing
- Privacy-first design: on-device processing without data persistence
- Camera API integration (CameraX/AVFoundation)
- Background thread processing for UI responsiveness

## Code Example

```javascript
// Usage sketch
function MyHistogram() { 
  const { histogram, ts } = useExposureHistogram({ 
    enabled: true, 
    frameRate: 15, 
    region: { x: 0, y: 0, width: 1, height: 1 } 
  });

  return <MinimalHistogramView histogram={histogram} />;
